00:35:53.150 --> 00:35:58.020
So, one interesting
dimension of State Capture

00:36:00.840 --> 00:36:05.160
is the ability of firms

00:36:07.550 --> 00:36:09.903
to use different form of State Capture.

00:36:11.650 --> 00:36:13.303
Direct form of State Capture,

00:36:14.340 --> 00:36:19.340
where the firms work with bureaucrats

00:36:21.010 --> 00:36:26.010
