00:36:33.240 --> 00:36:37.070
or they can also use
indirect form of set capture,

00:36:37.070 --> 00:36:42.070
which is they control
politicians to campaign donation,

00:36:42.430 --> 00:36:44.360
and then the politician control

00:36:44.360 --> 00:36:46.123
what the bureaucrats would do.

00:36:48.320 --> 00:36:52.530
And what we found in this paper

00:36:52.530 --> 00:36:56.830
is that when the electro
processes is competitive

00:37:02.610 --> 00:37:07.610
firm use direct form of
State Capture as an insurance

00:37:11.430 --> 00:37:14.320
against potential loss,

00:37:14.320 --> 00:37:17.860
due to the fact that the
politician that they support

00:37:17.860 --> 00:37:18.910
will be out of power.

00:37:21.060 --> 00:37:25.170
And we find evidence that
when we winning margin

00:37:25.170 --> 00:37:28.083
in local elections in Benin increases,

00:37:30.990 --> 00:37:35.990
the form of State Capture
that the firms use is direct.

00:37:37.230 --> 00:37:40.230
They tend to go after bureaucrats

00:37:40.230 --> 00:37:45.143
