office than politicians.

00:37:46.030 --> 00:37:48.020
And what is interesting

00:37:48.020 --> 00:37:51.063
is that the resolve this correlation,

00:37:51.063 --> 00:37:53.670
this correlation between
formal State Capture

00:37:54.730 --> 00:37:57.820
and competition, electoral competition

