00:57:28.664 --> 00:57:29.497
- Yeah.

00:57:29.497 --> 00:57:32.273
- So I think we have
some time for questions.

00:57:33.490 --> 00:57:36.180
If you have questions, then
Boomy has a mic up there.

00:57:36.180 --> 00:57:39.673
So if you just raise your
hand, she will come to you.

00:57:42.328 --> 00:57:45.030
