01:00:44.640 --> 01:00:49.113
can also amplify citizens engagement,

01:00:50.800 --> 01:00:55.800
but I strongly believe that at the start,

01:01:02.562 --> 01:01:07.510
the reason important the reason
is as important as public.

01:01:10.550 --> 01:01:15.550
It means that discussion
about public policy,

01:01:15.680 --> 01:01:20.680
discussion about not only
institutional design,

01:01:21.880 --> 01:01:23.280
it has to be first based on evidence.

01:01:23.280 --> 01:01:26.920
It has to be first based on some research,

01:01:26.920 --> 01:01:30.780
so that you can actually constrain

01:01:31.700 --> 01:01:35.400
the extent to which you
can have misinformation,

01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:40.400
or you can have the
