01:01:41.030 --> 01:01:45.270
to actually increase distortion,

01:01:45.270 --> 01:01:50.150
because taking advantage of how vulnerable

01:01:50.150 --> 01:01:53.560
some populations are, some vulnerable,

01:01:53.560 --> 01:01:58.560
some segment society are,
this press can be used

